# ============================================================================
# .gitignore
# ============================================================================
# This project has no build step and no package manager, so this file is
# short on purpose. Its job is to keep secrets and machine-local clutter out
# of the repository — not to exclude build output, because there is none.
#
# IMPORTANT: everything that IS committed here is also uploaded to Cloudflare
# Pages and served at a public URL. Committing a file and publishing it are
# the same act in this project. Think twice before adding anything that is
# not meant to be read by a stranger.
# ============================================================================

# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
# The real values live in Cloudflare's environment variables, never on disk.
# .env.example is committed deliberately; it holds variable NAMES only.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# --- Editor and OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- Local tooling ----------------------------------------------------------
# Cloudflare Wrangler's local state, if anyone runs it from this folder.
.wrangler/
.dev.vars

# --- Scratch ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Somewhere to put a throwaway script without it ending up on the live site.
scratch/
*.local.*

# Built by tools/build-dist.sh for Cloudflare Pages. Generated, never edited.
dist/
